title Resolve One Complete Agent Definition
participant Consumer
participant "Agent definition service" as Service
participant "Definition repository" as Definition
participant "Binding repository" as Bindings
participant "Tool repository" as Tools
Consumer -> Service : Query Agent runtime definition
Service -> Definition : Load root definition
Definition --> Service : Root metadata
break Root missing, disabled or invalid
  Service --> Consumer : Specific controlled error
end
Service -> Bindings : Load and order four binding collections
Bindings --> Service : Model, tool, Skill and Agent bindings
Service -> Tools : Resolve bound tool versions in batch
Tools --> Service : Tool definitions
Service -> Definition : Resolve direct bound Agent versions in batch
Definition --> Service : Flat Agent definitions
alt Root and dependencies valid
  Service -> Service : Compose complete response
  Service --> Consumer : Runtime definition
else Missing, disabled or invalid definition
  Service --> Consumer : Specific controlled error
end
note over Service,Tools
  One REPEATABLE_READ transaction; no recursive Agent expansion.
